  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: happy
    _text: "Oh! Your Majesty \u2014 you came! Welcome home to Oakville. Well\u2026
      to what the fog has left of it."
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: happy
    _text: "I\u2019m Isolde. I kept the royal library \u2014 but most of the court
      fled the fog, so\u2026 I\u2019m your Royal Advisor now!"
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: woodcutter
    _side: 1
    _expression: happy
    _text: Advisor. Ha! Last time she advised anyone, it was the old king. To read
      more.
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: worried
    _text: "This is Hob, our woodcutter. He\u2019s the only one who never left. He
      says the fog doesn\u2019t scare him."
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: woodcutter
    _side: 1
    _expression: 
    _text: "Scare me? It\u2019s greedy, that\u2019s all. Loves a shine. Toss it a
      coin and it gives a bit of ground back."
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: idea
    _text: "Then let\u2019s feed it! Those trees in the fog are ours \u2014 tap it,
      Your Majesty. Five coins, Hob says."
    _box: auto
    _point: feature:TreesFog
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 6
      _target: FirstSteps
      _amount: 1
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: surprised
    _text: "Timber! It worked! And look \u2014 right beside it. Something glinting
      in the fog. Clear that one too!"
    _box: auto
    _point: treasure
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 37
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: woodcutter
    _side: 1
    _expression: 
    _text: "That\u2019s Widow Pell\u2019s purse. Dropped it running, she did. Well
      \u2014 the fog owes us. Tap it."
    _box: auto
    _point: treasure
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 38
      _target: 
      _amount: 1
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: 
    _text: "The fog kept more of what they left, I\u2019m sure of it. Three more
      stands, and the axes will have work again."
    _box: auto
    _point: feature:TreesFog
    _lock: 1
    _until:
      _kind: 5
      _target: FirstSteps
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: happy
    _text: 
    _box: auto
    _point: back
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 17
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: happy
    _text: "The folk sheltering in the Townhall saw it all \u2014 they\u2019ve gathered
      you a gift! Go on, accept it."
    _box: auto
    _point: quest
